WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
Use two hands on a tabletop. Count in and listen first.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.950
Listen: left, right, left, left, right, left, right, right.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.950
One pattern takes four seconds. Keep the gaps equal.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.950
Follow the highlighted hand: L R L L R L R R.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.950
One tap every half second. Keep a steady pace.

6
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.950
Catch the left double: L L on beats three and four.

7
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.950
Catch the right double: R R on beats seven and eight.

8
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.950
Play along: L R L L R L R R.

9
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.950
Keep the same spacing, including the doubles.

10
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.950
Your turn. One guided round, then try it from memory.

11
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
No hand hints this round. Keep the eight-tap pattern.
